{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16843","headline":"登潜山观 · 窦参","name":"登潜山观","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山势欲相抱，一条微径盘。\n攀萝歇复行，始得凌仙坛。\n闻道葛夫子，此中链还丹。\n丹成五色光，服之生羽翰。\n灵草空自绿，余霞谁共餐。\n至今步虚处，犹有孤飞鸾。\n幽幽古殿门，下压浮云端。\n万丈水声落，四时松色寒。\n既入无何乡，转嫌人事难。\n终当远尘俗，高卧从所安。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16843.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16843","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}